        "summary": "Ligand-centered phosphorescence of the Gd9 cluster was used to locate the butylsalicylate T1 level at 461 nm (21690 cm−1) in chloroform at 210 K, giving ΔE ≈ 1070 cm−1 relative to Tb 5D4 and placing the family in the BET regime. No Tb 4f–4f emission is expected from this Gd-only cluster.",
